<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Radio started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Advanced Radio started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Monday it started coverage of Advanced Radio Telecom Corp with a rating of near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock rose 5/8 to 15-5/8 in early morning exchange trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
